Bubble sort--Compare adjacent pairs, swap if out of
order. Repeat until no swaps needed.
Best: O(n)
Avg/Worst: O(n²)    

Insertion sort--Pick next element, shift larger elements
right, insert it in the correct position.
Best: O(n)
Avg/Worst: O(n²)

Selection sort--Find the minimum in the unsorted part,
swap it to the sorted boundary.
Best/Avg/Worst:always O(n²)